## Summary of Architecture

**Player System:**
- `Player` wraps `PlayerControl`, implements `IPlayer`, `IBindPlayer`, `IGameOperator`, `ILifespan`
- Contains `RuntimeRole Role` property, `SetRole()` (local + RPC) and `SetRoleLocal()` (RPC-only)
- `PlayerManager` and `MyPlayer` are simpler `IPlayer` implementations (appears to be legacy/alternative)
- `GameManager` (singleton) implements `IGame`, manages all `IGameOperator` entities, calls `Update()` on `ModAbilityButton` instances each frame

**Role System:**
- `DefinedRole` (abstract) — definition with `Name`, `Color`, factory method `CreateInstance(Player)`
- `RuntimeRole` (abstract) — runtime instance bound to a `Player`, holds `List<IPlayerAbility>`, registers with EventSystem, auto-calls `OnActivated()` in constructor
- `ExampleRole` / `ExampleRuntime` — concrete example showing `AddAbility(new ExampleAbility(...))` in `OnActivated()`

**Ability System:**
- `IPlayerAbility` extends `IGameOperator` + `IBindPlayer`, has `HideKillButton`
- `AbstractPlayerAbility` extends `DependentLifespan`, implements `IPlayerAbility`, holds `MyPlayer`

**AbilityButton System:**
- `IModAbilityButton` (fluent interface) — chainable `.SetImage()`, `.SetLabel()`, `.BindKey()`, `.SetCooldown()`, `.SetAvailability()`, `.SetVisibility()`, `.Build()`
- `ModAbilityButton` — concrete implementation, clones `HudManager.Instance.KillButton`, registers with lifespan, has `Update()` called by `GameManager`, supports cooldown timer, key binding, and visibility/availability predicates
- `AbilityButtonFactory` — static factory with `CreateNormal()` and `Create()` convenience methods
- `IAbilityButton` / `AbilityButtonImpl` — simpler legacy interface

**Core Lifespan System:**
- `ILifespan` — `IsDeadObject`, `IsAliveObject`
- `IReleasable` — `Release()`
- `SimpleLifespan` — bool flag
- `DependentLifespan` — delegates to parent `ILifespan`
- `FlexibleLifespan` — combines dependent + self-release
- `IGameOperator` — extends `IGameComponent` + `IReleasable` + `ILifespan`, has `OnReleased()`

**Event System:**
- Reflection-based: `EventSystem.ScanAndRegisterAll()` scans assembly for methods taking `IEvent` parameters
- `RegisterInstance()` / `UnregisterInstance()` binds instances to cached listener entries
- `RunEvent<T>()` dispatches with priority sorting, supports `[OnlyHost]`, `[OnlyMyPlayer]`, `[Local]`, `[EventPriority]` attributes
- Event types: `PlayerSuicideEvent`, `PlayerMurderEvent`, `ShowChatEvent`, `HideChatEvent`, `GameStartEvent`

**Entry Point:**
- `LIDPlugin.Load()` — Harmony patches, chat command interception, `MetaScreen` injection, event scan, language loading
- `GameManager_StartGame_Patch` triggers `GameManager.Instance.Initialize()` and `GameStartEvent` on game start
- `PatchManager.OnSendChat` — chat command handler supporting `/sr` (set role), `/test`, `/suicide`, `/showchat`, `/hidechat`, `/sw`, `/code`, `/kick`

